      <graphic xml:id="m-bd6e42cc-dd03-472e-b5ae-7f8400917b81" target="2144_original_image.tiff" /><zone xml:id="m-4ba4c59b-b071-4eae-8f47-61e5ef009a77" ulx="452" uly="72" lrx="581" lry="99" /><zone xml:id="m-979f66b3-e9d2-4e8a-8be4-780e1517b1db" ulx="133" uly="74" lrx="173" lry="102" /><zone xml:id="m-92b56830-81b9-40ad-b6c3-42b19c2b0751" ulx="163" uly="112" lrx="906" lry="149" /><zone xml:id="m-e80b68d1-3fff-4f4f-96b3-af70fa65b674" ulx="129" uly="137" lrx="252" lry="170" /><zone xml:id="m-97df3946-72bd-45a6-8679-7ca1a92ac4e1" ulx="167" uly="156" lrx="909" lry="197" /><zone xml:id="m-f87f3275-e697-420e-8944-d6e25abcd597" ulx="130" uly="184" lrx="280" lry="217" /><zone xml:id="m-4c03ebc2-bf8b-4b53-a26d-28676945ba82" ulx="167" uly="209" lrx="909" lry="243" /><zone xml:id="m-6de98756-5a62-4821-a966-dd468c1cc672" ulx="130" uly="235" lrx="371" lry="270" /><zone xml:id="m-f0623fda-9b35-439c-9aa9-91976bbbdca3" ulx="167" uly="257" lrx="830" lry="293" /><zone xml:id="m-052ede26-f71c-4b9c-ad89-ea09892958c9" ulx="158" uly="285" lrx="911" lry="326" /><zone xml:id="m-6f206b31-d030-4393-b2c8-f70b6519ff87" ulx="131" uly="312" lrx="380" lry="348" /><zone xml:id="m-4908d3f8-dcb6-44cb-b6e1-b1c3c005837d" ulx="157" uly="336" lrx="910" lry="371" /><zone xml:id="m-cffacd4c-d526-4833-aa9a-335f1593a9dd" ulx="132" uly="362" lrx="270" lry="395" /><zone xml:id="m-774319dd-b6c1-4ed6-8e23-923503261f98" ulx="158" uly="385" lrx="910" lry="419" /><zone xml:id="m-e3602e1e-1b79-4cb9-8d52-3a5a47b21a7c" ulx="158" uly="414" lrx="910" lry="450" /><zone xml:id="m-65cb936d-953c-4d00-8875-d509d11db908" ulx="131" uly="439" lrx="258" lry="473" /><zone xml:id="m-4329d1dd-d931-476d-8811-1131b3b86d05" ulx="158" uly="463" lrx="896" lry="499" /><zone xml:id="m-074d3382-cc17-4d35-8e07-f170f4d8c446" ulx="158" uly="498" lrx="910" lry="526" /><zone xml:id="m-4641ab09-a4d6-4e47-8513-559881e58061" ulx="158" uly="521" lrx="910" lry="554" /><zone xml:id="m-00a03f85-9aa2-4873-aea3-4ab4399db8e3" ulx="133" uly="547" lrx="276" lry="577" /><zone xml:id="m-f038e01b-1d94-421e-ad0b-69c891d05d0d" ulx="158" uly="569" lrx="649" lry="603" /><zone xml:id="m-b3b204f0-20d6-4dd8-8c2f-5d68aff45f06" ulx="158" uly="598" lrx="910" lry="633" /><zone xml:id="m-70c7c410-4cbc-425f-bfd7-674f749abf1c" ulx="133" uly="623" lrx="283" lry="659" /><zone xml:id="m-c8b7fe0a-6b8e-4db2-8fe7-c9ea7976cfc4" ulx="428" uly="660" lrx="617" lry="692" /><zone xml:id="m-1039913d-fddc-4304-992c-6a099f5cab88" ulx="171" uly="697" lrx="880" lry="731" /><zone xml:id="m-6ca1a2c5-27db-4eac-8004-7ef6d9f1d752" ulx="171" uly="730" lrx="911" lry="765" /><zone xml:id="m-79db3b8b-d7a7-4dcd-91af-3e5900fdf862" ulx="134" uly="755" lrx="362" lry="781" /><zone xml:id="m-0ee0a228-e197-41dd-8764-00c30aaee6be" ulx="170" uly="778" lrx="910" lry="810" /><zone xml:id="m-0f0068ab-cae6-4925-bbb2-394feb0434cc" ulx="135" uly="801" lrx="381" lry="834" /><zone xml:id="m-70989fb6-74f7-4cd8-a5a5-ff65d91dc601" ulx="172" uly="825" lrx="793" lry="857" /><zone xml:id="m-6f8d2ad7-8762-4302-a0f1-fb238e07a849" ulx="171" uly="858" lrx="881" lry="884" /><zone xml:id="m-e650bc45-1e7b-4f6f-a5bb-2afd57bf5b02" ulx="171" uly="880" lrx="723" lry="913" /><zone xml:id="m-7496a6b9-efa7-4307-8c43-4b261fd2eb90" ulx="171" uly="908" lrx="865" lry="939" /><zone xml:id="m-0222df19-5335-4113-9025-127ca1f35158" ulx="169" uly="936" lrx="911" lry="973" /><zone xml:id="m-430db8c1-f153-4658-aa93-e16069e26d6e" ulx="135" uly="960" lrx="281" lry="995" /><zone xml:id="m-39147d27-f9a3-4ee0-be81-5ab0545fd876" ulx="171" uly="986" lrx="861" lry="1019" /><zone xml:id="m-b72ac307-cd04-4b26-a8da-0a495b2e45dc" ulx="162" uly="1015" lrx="658" lry="1043" /><zone xml:id="m-f6fc1293-b363-4f6c-84c5-d350f6ef65fb" ulx="160" uly="1041" lrx="911" lry="1075" /><zone xml:id="m-26649401-7875-40f8-ba98-78348f70cc7a" ulx="135" uly="1068" lrx="285" lry="1099" /><zone xml:id="m-d5fc6839-eea6-4159-a3d5-126bb615151a" ulx="162" uly="1090" lrx="858" lry="1123" /><zone xml:id="m-1f0754e1-46b4-4e42-8550-544fdb198604" ulx="162" uly="1123" lrx="865" lry="1156" /><zone xml:id="m-5e8042f0-15ee-497d-b239-6487fddcae9a" ulx="162" uly="1148" lrx="910" lry="1183" /><zone xml:id="m-4fb610e2-95b0-4107-9f31-5f650782d753" ulx="135" uly="1169" lrx="237" lry="1204" /><zone xml:id="m-2b80bee6-3ac5-432c-b8d3-13ff19f599d5" ulx="161" uly="1194" lrx="910" lry="1233" /><zone xml:id="m-c26eb074-369d-4332-a8e7-ee661d1a6677" ulx="135" uly="1221" lrx="243" lry="1251" /><zone xml:id="m-bc38f4d0-ad12-4f81-af34-bfffbada936c" ulx="162" uly="1243" lrx="909" lry="1280" /><zone xml:id="m-b6201f8e-9de3-4368-899d-c12bd51a6fd8" ulx="135" uly="1268" lrx="246" lry="1299" /><zone xml:id="m-791ceaef-bf64-4521-b829-76af3160bb99" ulx="161" uly="1297" lrx="649" lry="1332" /><zone xml:id="m-91007e7d-7a73-46fa-afdc-b22b05df84b4" ulx="162" uly="1324" lrx="905" lry="1360" /><zone xml:id="m-6725ad8a-ce18-40f9-abbf-9921564ae67a" ulx="136" uly="1346" lrx="284" lry="1379" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-b55fada1-6119-4d9a-be78-241bf46b132c" n="2144" facs="#m-fc96cce5-9c97-4d9f-b6fd-ed9cce8e59fc" /><div xml:id="m-7b9aeb59-d646-47b0-8c7f-8afa1556111a">
            <lg xml:id="m-5331517d-8c9a-4f60-b3cd-c7d65dd8c65a">
              <l xml:id="m-06ea7b00-5e1d-4cc7-89b7-f328a511fa73" facs="#m-4ba4c59b-b071-4eae-8f47-61e5ef009a77" label="ambiguous">Appendix</l><l xml:id="m-60459ff9-2461-4a7e-96c4-abebc9510ab0" facs="#m-979f66b3-e9d2-4e8a-8be4-780e1517b1db" label="ambiguous">18*</l><l xml:id="m-244bbca2-c5c4-40f2-8b6d-571c0177d8fe" facs="#m-92b56830-81b9-40ad-b6c3-42b19c2b0751" label="lyrics-like">6. Omnia mandáta túa sunt fidélia;*immérito persequúntur me:</l><l xml:id="m-d2c6fa9f-cf13-4dee-857e-6e9e4a17d2bf" facs="#m-e80b68d1-3fff-4f4f-96b3-af70fa65b674" label="lyrics-like">ádiuva me.</l><l xml:id="m-75a06608-f7f6-4136-8962-0d87c0cb4987" facs="#m-97df3946-72bd-45a6-8679-7ca1a92ac4e1" label="lyrics-like">7. Propémodum confecérunt me in térra; Y égo autem non dereliqui</l><l xml:id="m-50186b4b-eeeb-4e10-9b69-0962c0034663" facs="#m-f87f3275-e697-420e-8944-d6e25abcd597" label="lyrics-like">praecépta túa.</l><l xml:id="m-67428472-dc00-438a-85ec-4558a104282c" facs="#m-4c03ebc2-bf8b-4b53-a26d-28676945ba82" label="lyrics-like">s. Secúndum misericórdiam túam sérva me vivum, *et custódiam</l><l xml:id="m-a850c207-05d2-4e6e-ae1b-f3bae0b74c3e" facs="#m-6de98756-5a62-4821-a966-dd468c1cc672" label="lyrics-like">praescripta óris túi.—</l><l xml:id="m-bcbaa730-87e3-4166-8514-30a648ddba22" facs="#m-f0623fda-9b35-439c-9aa9-91976bbbdca3" label="lyrics-like">9. In aetérnum, Dómine, est vérbum túum * stábile ut caélum.</l><l xml:id="m-a866d2f4-85ad-42b8-822d-7d3677ff2a43" facs="#m-052ede26-f71c-4b9c-ad89-ea09892958c9" label="lyrics-like">10. In generatiónem et generatiónem est fidélitas túacdidisti</l><l xml:id="m-241c3610-8436-4578-9cab-fe08f488c0a2" facs="#m-6f206b31-d030-4393-b2c8-f70b6519ff87" label="lyrics-like">térram, quue pérmanet.</l><l xml:id="m-afc95bd2-7c03-4737-b690-52eeefa63bd5" facs="#m-4908d3f8-dcb6-44cb-b6e1-b1c3c005837d" label="lyrics-like">11. Secúndum decréta túa cónstant ómmni témpore, * quia univérsa</l><l xml:id="m-29730901-dc91-4130-99ef-9464e71d3972" facs="#m-cffacd4c-d526-4833-aa9a-335f1593a9dd" label="lyrics-like">séroiunt tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-f3b182e2-cd09-4394-aa2f-feb6a983b214" facs="#m-774319dd-b6c1-4ed6-8e23-923503261f98" label="lyrics-like">12. Nísi lex túa delectátio méa ésset, * jam periissem in afflictiône méa.</l><l xml:id="m-86a86114-1f33-45c2-a7d8-1b8d4239aed3" facs="#m-e3602e1e-1b79-4cb9-8d52-3a5a47b21a7c" label="lyrics-like">13. In aetérnum non obliviscar praecépia túa,quia ipsis dedisti</l><l xml:id="m-f3b24788-1b2e-442b-b144-8d1310700c2d" facs="#m-65cb936d-953c-4d00-8875-d509d11db908" label="ambiguous">mhi vitam.</l><l xml:id="m-499f6d91-4948-4b4e-b02b-3f58238b5b73" facs="#m-4329d1dd-d931-476d-8811-1131b3b86d05" label="lyrics-like">14. Túus sum égo : sálvum mé fac, r quóniam praecépta túa quaesivi.</l><l xml:id="m-cb44fd6f-2ce0-4224-a4bf-13a019231408" facs="#m-074d3382-cc17-4d35-8e07-f170f4d8c446" label="lyrics-like">15. Me exspéctant peccatóres ut pérdant me; 4 ad praescripta túa atténdo.</l><l xml:id="m-ebe2d940-7f1b-4634-a3c0-29b2e1436126" facs="#m-4641ab09-a4d6-4e47-8513-559881e58061" label="lyrics-like">16. Omnis perfectiónis vidi ésse términum: “latissime pátet man¬</l><l xml:id="m-c635abd6-0424-4cf7-93e3-878a6fdbba3d" facs="#m-00a03f85-9aa2-4873-aea3-4ab4399db8e3" label="lyrics-like">dátum túum.</l><l xml:id="m-18eb7689-5fb4-40f6-b5ea-50986b16a54f" facs="#m-f038e01b-1d94-421e-ad0b-69c891d05d0d" label="lyrics-like">17. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-b505d88c-6fc3-417a-9bd0-4caf03e54e5f" facs="#m-b3b204f0-20d6-4dd8-8c2f-5d68aff45f06" label="lyrics-like">18. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-52672c18-cce3-4b16-b673-2f38319a8574" facs="#m-70c7c410-4cbc-425f-bfd7-674f749abf1c" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-5d184125-96ae-46e0-9940-366e6ea842fb" facs="#m-c8b7fe0a-6b8e-4db2-8fe7-c9ea7976cfc4" label="ambiguous">Psalm nIS, VII</l><l xml:id="m-52f14765-98d5-46e9-a583-d5a7334cbd6e" facs="#m-1039913d-fddc-4304-992c-6a099f5cab88" label="lyrics-like">1. Quam diligo légem túam, Dómine!* tóto die meditátio méa est.</l><l xml:id="m-10df2d7a-cdee-44dc-a21b-b6b1e7ee8a5f" facs="#m-6ca1a2c5-27db-4eac-8004-7ef6d9f1d752" label="lyrics-like">2. Inimicis méis sapientiórem me fécit mandátum túum, * quia in</l><l xml:id="m-dfa89054-f38c-48f0-bbc7-3187e529b131" facs="#m-79db3b8b-d7a7-4dcd-91af-3e5900fdf862" label="lyrics-like">aetérnum mécum est.</l><l xml:id="m-299b4a6b-50d8-4f4e-bf90-57a18d081ac1" facs="#m-0ee0a228-e197-41dd-8764-00c30aaee6be" label="lyrics-like">3. Omnibus docéntibus me prudéntior sum, quia de praescriptis</l><l xml:id="m-d54a21ee-3d8e-4661-927f-47d31da06610" facs="#m-0f0068ab-cae6-4925-bbb2-394feb0434cc" label="lyrics-like">túis meditátio méa est.</l><l xml:id="m-460f5c4a-6037-473d-ad89-0034ac77f4ee" facs="#m-70989fb6-74f7-4cd8-a5a5-ff65d91dc601" label="lyrics-like">4. Sénibus intelligéntior sum * quia praecépta túa obsérvo.</l><l xml:id="m-79c4a56d-ddcc-4d3e-b010-5bfcd560eeab" facs="#m-6f8d2ad7-8762-4302-a0f1-fb238e07a849" label="lyrics-like">5. Ab ómni vía mála cohibeo pédes méos, r ut custódiam vérba túa.</l><l xml:id="m-9c47ca27-2afd-4988-9bb2-ce212116419e" facs="#m-e650bc45-1e7b-4f6f-a5bb-2afd57bf5b02" label="lyrics-like">G. A decrétis tuis non declino, * quia tu docuisti me.</l><l xml:id="m-7b602fd3-f396-4466-bd79-2b23dcc93e3b" facs="#m-7496a6b9-efa7-4307-8c43-4b261fd2eb90" label="lyrics-like">7. Quam dúlcia paláto méo elóquia túa! * super mel sunt óri méo.</l><l xml:id="m-9c95fc71-2dba-4030-ae5e-f4e25b2dd42f" facs="#m-0222df19-5335-4113-9025-127ca1f35158" label="lyrics-like">8. Praecéptis tuis intéllige , proptérea ódi ómnem viam</l><l xml:id="m-78d5e662-1718-43ef-9644-d573963afa6b" facs="#m-430db8c1-f153-4658-aa93-e16069e26d6e" label="lyrics-like">iniquitátis.—</l><l xml:id="m-fc2228d0-2cd5-40b9-b36d-ac3ae373c63e" facs="#m-39147d27-f9a3-4ee0-be81-5ab0545fd876" label="lyrics-like">9. Lucérna pédibus méis vérbum túum, * et lúmen sémitae méae.</l><l xml:id="m-9ee233cc-2a44-4a4b-af5b-75fd0e747ac9" facs="#m-b72ac307-cd04-4b26-a8da-0a495b2e45dc" label="lyrics-like">10. Júro et státuo * custodire jústa decréta túa.</l><l xml:id="m-782514ec-c099-4bc0-a51b-6f5720f95e12" facs="#m-f6fc1293-b363-4f6c-84c5-d350f6ef65fb" label="lyrics-like">11. Afflictus sum veheménter,. Dómine: * vivum me sérva secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-87d65825-c454-4a81-b54b-2c838d952347" facs="#m-26649401-7875-40f8-ba98-78348f70cc7a" label="lyrics-like">vérbum túum.</l><l xml:id="m-1dc61145-e12a-4096-bbec-a97b591eac24" facs="#m-d5fc6839-eea6-4159-a3d5-126bb615151a" label="lyrics-like">12. Oblatiónes óris méi áccipe, Dómine, * et decréta túa dóce me.</l><l xml:id="m-7667f4eb-7284-4407-a489-e47cfec634db" facs="#m-1f0754e1-46b4-4e42-8550-544fdb198604" label="lyrics-like">13. Vita méa periclitátur sémper, * sed légem túam non obliviscor.</l><l xml:id="m-9f6095f2-9c27-4a74-84b1-8d6b67ca193d" facs="#m-5e8042f0-15ee-497d-b239-6487fddcae9a" label="lyrics-like">14. Posuérunt peccatóres láqueum mihi, * sed a praecéptis. túis non</l><l xml:id="m-dafcd548-0443-4af5-99ba-6e2aecf48256" facs="#m-4fb610e2-95b0-4107-9f31-5f650782d753" label="lyrics-like">aberrávi.</l><l xml:id="m-03a62396-e4be-4f15-9955-82459139c896" facs="#m-2b80bee6-3ac5-432c-b8d3-13ff19f599d5" label="lyrics-like">15. Heréditas méa praescripta túa in aetérnum, * quia gáudium córdi¬</l><l xml:id="m-2045c2a1-d07a-4264-ad5d-59e88e83da90" facs="#m-c26eb074-369d-4332-a8e7-ee661d1a6677" label="lyrics-like">méi sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-046e637b-39d8-4cb5-8950-027262a79724" facs="#m-bc38f4d0-ad12-4f81-af34-bfffbada936c" label="lyrics-like">16. Inclinávi cor méum ad statúta túa implénda: * perpétuo, ac</l><l xml:id="m-50f34f13-f30c-4de9-a00e-21414dbee487" facs="#m-b6201f8e-9de3-4368-899d-c12bd51a6fd8" label="lyrics-like">amússim.</l><l xml:id="m-a4bf855d-f411-4b30-898d-657db7dd1d94" facs="#m-791ceaef-bf64-4521-b829-76af3160bb99" label="lyrics-like">17. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-11772451-31eb-44e6-bb98-e7afcefc5d7e" facs="#m-91007e7d-7a73-46fa-afdc-b22b05df84b4" label="lyrics-like">18. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc, et sémper, et in saécula saecu</l><l xml:id="m-a529cadf-b3f9-45e7-bd16-7688e3508e40" facs="#m-6725ad8a-ce18-40f9-abbf-9921564ae67a" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>